<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33037" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτομ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτέμνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cutting out, excision</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				16
			</span></i> (pl.): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονῶν,
			λόγου</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.450
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				170
			</span></i>; <i>cutting off</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>castration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.48
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				195c
			</span></i> (pl.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>circumcision</i> of women, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.2.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>segment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γῆς</span>
			<i>sod</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				41
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cutting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρημνώδης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Flam.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>excision</i> in woodwork, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				64.27
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
